# OHOS clang15/libc++15 C++20 兼容全谱: ranges/format/views/spaceship
# 缺口的系统性处理 + P0960 聚合括号初始化 + structured-binding lambda
# 捕获 + monolithic bundle 跳过 IMPORTED 依赖
# 触发事件: dawn 0.0-git20260529.432db5d7 HarmonyOS PC 适配
#   （archives/d/dawn/0.0-git20260529.432db5d7，0001-0029 补丁族）
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-dawn-0.0-git20260529-libcxx15-cpp20-compat-ensemble
source_lib:             dawn 0.0-git20260529.432db5d7
trigger_tool:           clang|clang++|cmake|conan|ninja
phase:                  compilation|link|test
error_signature:        no member named 'copy' in namespace 'std::ranges'|
                         no member named 'reverse' in namespace 'std::ranges'|
                         no member named 'views' in namespace 'std'|
                         no member named 'format' in namespace 'std'|
                         no member named 'lexicographical_compare_three_way' in namespace 'std'|
                         missing 'typename' prior to dependent type name|
                         reference to local binding .* declared in enclosing function|
                         no matching constructor for initialization of '.*::overloaded'|
                         archive member 'libabsl_.*\.a' is neither ET_REL nor LLVM bitcode|
                         no matching constructor for initialization of 'std::span<char>'

severity:               3
category:               libcxx, toolchain, compat, cxx20, portability, clang15, conan, monolithic-bundle, gtest
match_keywords:         std::ranges, std::views, std::format, lexicographical_compare_three_way,
                         P0960, parenthesized aggregate, structured binding, lambda capture,
                         overloaded deduction guide, span CTAD, BundleLibraries, IMPORTED,
                         nested archive, gtest TMPDIR, read-only /tmp, dawn, webgpu
title:                  OHOS clang15/libc++15 的 C++20 兼容缺口需全谱替换, 大库聚合场景还需处理 P0960/结构化绑定捕获/IMPORTED bundle 嵌套

root_cause:             OHOS SDK26 自带 clang15 + libcxx-ohos15:
                        (1) 未实现 std::ranges 算法与 std::views (ranges 仅部分,
                        <format> 为空 stub, spaceship 部分缺失);
                        (2) 不支持 C++20 聚合括号初始化 P0960 (TableAndExpected{...}
                        可, (a, b) 不可);
                        (3) lambda 无法按引用捕获结构化绑定 (auto [a,b] 后 [&] 引用);
                        (4) span 无法从 string_view 直接 CTAD;
                        (5) 依赖类型上下文 (模板内 Base::reference / Sha3<T>::Output /
                        Traits::MutexType / ForwardToServerHelper<F>::Userdata) 需要
                        explicit typename;
                        (6) 编译器不生成 overloaded{} 的 deduction guide
                        (聚合 CTAD + lambda 成员);
                        (7) CMake bundle_libraries 遇到 conan IMPORTED 静态库时把
                        .a 文件作为成员嵌入 webgpu_dawn.a, lld 无法解析嵌套 archive
                        → undefined absl symbols; E236 是 libtool .la 场景, 此为其
                        CMake/conan 静态库场景;
                        (8) OHOS /tmp 只读导致 gtest captured-stream 失败 (E002 族),
                        gtest 通用分支硬编码 /tmp.

affected_scope:         C++20/Chromium 生态大型库在 OHOS PC 适配; 使用 std::ranges/
                        std::format/std::views/spaceship 或 CMake bundle 静态库 +
                        conan 注入依赖的包; gtest 测试在只读 /tmp 环境运行的包

verification_cmd:       "conan create archives/d/dawn/0.0-git20260529.432db5d7
                        -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=同 --build=missing
                        → PASS; ./tint_unittests 44484/44484; ./dawn_end2end_tests
                        292/292 (Null backend)"

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           systematic-libcxx15-cpp20-compat-ensemble
rec_description:        >
  ① ranges/format/views/spaceship: 逐个替换为经典算法等价
  (std::ranges::copy→std::copy(b,e), std::ranges::reverse→std::reverse(b,e),
  std::ranges::equal→std::equal(b,e,b2), std::ranges::search→std::search,
  std::format→std::to_string/流拼接, lexicographical_compare_three_way→手工
  strong_ordering 三路循环, std::views::filter/values→直接循环);
  ② P0960: 聚合体 (Type(a, b)) 改为大括号 Type{a, b};
  ③ 结构化绑定+lambda: 改为显式中间变量 (auto item = ...; auto& x=item.first);
  ④ span CTAD: string_view 构造用 (reinterpret_cast<const byte*>(data), size);
  ⑤ typename: 依赖类型前补 explicit typename;
  ⑥ overloaded: 补模板 deduction guide;
  ⑦ BundleLibraries.cmake: 收集对象时跳过 IMPORTED 目标 (is_imported), 由消费者
  链接 conan 提供的 abseil; 同时 conanfile requirements 用 visible=False,
  package_info ignored_requires, test_package 链接 libabsl_*.a 全库;
  ⑧ gtest-port.cc: 通用分支尊重 TMPDIR 环境变量 (E002 族).
  CMake 无 OHOS 平台模块: generate() 设 CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=Linux +
  CMAKE_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR=aarch64, 显式关闭 X11/GLFW/Vulkan 等 (E092 已有).

rec_command:            "见 archives/d/dawn/0.0-git20260529.432db5d7/patches/0001-0029"
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-edit

causes:
caused_by:              E130 (OHOS libc++ 需 C++17 最低), E092 (CMake 无 OHOS 平台),
                        E002 (/tmp 只读)
similar_to:             DRAFT-ohos-libcxx15-missing-cpp20-ranges-algorithms,
                        DRAFT-ohos-libcxx15-format-ranges-capability-gap,
                        DRAFT-libcxx15-missing-cpp20-spaceship,
                        DRAFT-ohos-libcxx-missing-std-views,
                        DRAFT-graaf-1.1.0-ohos-libcxx-std-ranges-missing,
                        E236 (libtool .la 嵌套 archive — 触发面不同但 lld 报错同形)
conflicts_with:
